severity: high
environment: "pm-cli 2026.9.4 and 2026.8.31, Linux ext4 after a disk-full truncation, sandbox tracker"
repro_steps: "Create an item, update it twice, verify the chain, truncate the .toon to zero bytes, run pm get and pm restore <id> <last-version>, then append NUL bytes to the history stream and retry"
resolution: "Complete verified recovery and tail salvage, actionable corrupt-item diagnostics, required Windows recurrence coverage and lossless size-compliant SDK manifest packaging."
expected_result: "Recovery preserves verified bytes and identity, diagnosis names both damaged files, and packaged consumers retain the documented SDK manifest export."
actual_result: "Focused diagnostics, health, finalizer and workflow-contract regressions passed; full exact coverage, static quality, temporary-tracker acceptance and packed consumers passed. Hosted Windows and renewed review are pending."
